          "grammarIds": [1,2,3,6,16,21,22]
        },
        {
          "it": "«La compagnia ci lascia senza nave», dice Turi. «Allora ce la facciamo da soli.",
          "en": "\"The company is leaving us without a boat,\" says Turi. \"So we're making one ourselves.",
          "tokens": [
            {"text":"La","start":1,"end":3,"lemmaId":572321737},
            {"text":"compagnia","start":4,"end":13,"lemmaId":480774766},
            {"text":"ci","start":14,"end":16,"lemmaId":1407154832},
            {"text":"lascia","start":17,"end":23,"lemmaId":1442795260},
